**/env/

# 3. Python Cache & Compilation
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.pytest_cache/

# 4. Vector Database (ChromaDB lokal agar repo tidak bengkak)
**/chroma_db/
chroma_db/

# 5. Frontend Node Modules & Build Output
**/node_modules/
node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
.next/
.turbo/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# 6. IDE, Editor & OS Artefak
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
logs/
**/logs/
*.jsonl
